  "markdown": "Material family\n\n# Murals\n\nPrinted or hand-made scenes, including event murals hung for a fixed date.\n\n![The Calico Wallpaper landscape mural running unbroken around a corner of the Terminal 4 store.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/heathrow-03-800.webp)\n\nA Calico Wallpaper landscape continues around an internal corner at Heathrow Terminal 4. The scene and the return were set out together before the store fixtures went in.Photograph: Dorin Burcus / Mr Wallcover.[Heathrow: the project](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/heathrow-terminal-4-calico/)\n\nBefore you choose\n\n**Consider it when**\n: One wall or a room needs a planned composition rather than a repeating pattern.\n\n**The trade-off**\n: A preview cannot confirm the real colour, texture or precise crop.\n\n**Before ordering**\n: Confirm scale, panel count, sequence, backing and care instructions.\n\n01 · The finish\n\n## Joins\n\nSet out from a fixed point so the image meets where it should. A roll calculator will not price a mural.\n\n02 · The setting\n\n## Where it belongs\n\nA single wall or a room with a scene\n\n03 · Installation\n\n## Handling\n\nCheck the panel count, the sequence and the substrate before the first piece is opened.\n\n04 · Living with it\n\n## Care\n\nFollow the maker. An event mural is not the same duty as a guest-room vinyl.\n\nDigital colour is a guide. Order a cutting or a sample before you commit to a room. We can install material you have already bought, or source a family and install it. Either way, the next step is a short note about the room.\n\nIllustrative material study · confirm the actual finish with a sample\n\nPause motion\n\nSave to shortlist\n\nSaved on this device only.\n\n[Discuss this material](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source&service=wallcovering&topic=material%3Amurals) [I already have it](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=install&service=wallcovering&topic=material%3Amurals)\n\n[How we install it](https://www.mrwallcover.com/services/mural-installation/)\n\nInstallation experience\n\n## On the record\n\nOur published murals include Calico Wallpaper's Overture for [Lee Broom](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-lee-broom-overture/) (2025), Estuary for [Ahluwalia at Rosewood London](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-ahluwalia-estuary-rosewood/) (2026) and a painted landscape at [Heathrow Terminal 4](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/heathrow-terminal-4-calico/), hung overnight in 2018. Muraspec's extra-wide digital prints went up at the [Everyman cinema in Liverpool](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/everyman-liverpool/) and at [Oxygen Freejumping, The O2](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/oxygen-freejumping-the-o2/), and a blue gradient mural at the [SCP showroom in Pimlico](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/scp-showroom-pimlico/).\n\n[Mural installation](https://www.mrwallcover.com/services/mural-installation/) explains the survey and the sequence.\n\nPlan the detail\n\n## Useful reading\n\n- [Hand-painted papers and murals](https://www.mrwallcover.com/advice/hand-painted-murals-set-out/)\n\nFrom our portfolio\n\n## Selected work\n\n- [Lee Broom x Calico Wallpaper: 'Overture' at the Lee Broom Shoreditch showroom](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-lee-broom-overture/)\n- [Ahluwalia x Calico Wallpaper: 'Estuary' at Rosewood London](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-ahluwalia-estuary-rosewood/)\n- [Calico Wallpaper airside at Heathrow: a luxury fashion house's store, Terminal 4](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/heathrow-terminal-4-calico/)\n- [Everyman cinema, Liverpool](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/everyman-liverpool/)\n- [Oxygen Freejumping, The O2](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/oxygen-freejumping-the-o2/)\n- [SCP showroom, Pimlico](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/scp-showroom-pimlico/)\n- [Brown's Hotel, Mayfair](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/browns-hotel-mayfair/)\n- [Raffles London at The OWO, Whitehall](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/raffles-london-the-owo/)\n- [Four Seasons Hotel London at Ten Trinity Square](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/four-seasons-ten-trinity-square/)\n\nMakers installed\n\n## Murals: makers we have hung\n\nEach in our own photograph of its product on the wall. A maker named here means Mr Wallcover installed that maker's product; it is not an approval, accreditation or endorsement.\n\n- ![Room with a deep blue Calico gradient wallpaper, a yellow sideboard and a daybed, a private project, London.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/brand-calico-wallpaper-01-800.webp)\n\n### Calico Wallpaper\n\nInstalled at a private project, London, 2019. [Our post](https://www.instagram.com/p/B2Uz7Dcl2_j/).\n\n- ![Black matt Muraspec walls around a door with a brushed stainless-steel trim, Mercedes-AMG showroom, London.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/mercedes-amg-02-800.webp)\n\n### Muraspec\n\nInstalled at [Everyman cinema, Liverpool](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/everyman-liverpool/) · [Four Seasons Hotel London at Ten Trinity Square](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/four-seasons-ten-trinity-square/) · [Hilton London Metropole](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/hilton-london-metropole/) · [Mercedes-AMG showroom, London](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/mercedes-amg-showroom-london/) · [Oxygen Freejumping, The O2](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/oxygen-freejumping-the-o2/).\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last reviewed 9 October 2026\n",
